{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outrun your friends. Outsmart your rivals. Out-chaos them all!</strong><br>From the makers of <i>Running Fable</i> comes <i>Petite Party</i>, a wild and unpredictable spin-off that cranks up the chaos. Battle through <strong>16 competitive mini-games</strong> and dominate the <strong>tabletop party board</strong> where anything goes. In <i>Running Fable Petite Party</i>, there\u2019s no holding back \u2014 every round is a chance to <strong>taunt your friends</strong>, <strong>steal victory</strong>, and <strong>cause maximum mayhem</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/17983c9c845c8c259288cdda7accee9f.poster.avif?t=1768836594\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/17983c9c845c8c259288cdda7accee9f.webm?t=1768836594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/17983c9c845c8c259288cdda7accee9f.mp4?t=1768836594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Mayhem-Fueled Mini-Games</strong> \u2013 Outsprint, outbalance, outwit, or outright sabotage your friends in quick-fire challenges designed to trigger laughs and playful rage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop Strategy Meets Party Madness</strong> \u2013 Roll the dice and plan across 3 competitive boards where the smallest choices lead to the biggest betrayals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rivalry Ready</strong> \u2013 Perfect for 1\u20134 players; whether you\u2019re teaming up or turning on each other, every match is a test of speed, reflexes, and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Teasing</strong> \u2013 Easy controls mean anyone can join in, but only the bold (and lucky) can claim victory. Trash talk encouraged.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the World of Running Fable</strong> \u2013 Return to a vibrant, fabled universe full of quirky characters, ridiculous physics, and hilarious animations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/d54e38d96387f5b70b51170fc33e93af.poster.avif?t=1768836594\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/d54e38d96387f5b70b51170fc33e93af.webm?t=1768836594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/d54e38d96387f5b70b51170fc33e93af.mp4?t=1768836594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s not just a party \u2014 it\u2019s a battlefield disguised in balloons.</strong><br><i>Running Fable Petite Party</i> is what happens when tabletop strategy meets competitive chaos. Who will stand victorious? And who will never live that loss down?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866300?t=1768836594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3866300?t=1768836594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/0575c79b7e60636bf7bd2a9ec90f5008a5f2cd94/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768836594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/0575c79b7e60636bf7bd2a9ec90f5008a5f2cd94/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768836594","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descriptio