/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tabletop Strategy Meets Party Madness</strong> \u2013 Roll the dice and plan across 3 competitive boards where the smallest choices lead to the biggest betrayals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rivalry Ready</strong> \u2013 Perfect for 1\u20134 players; whether you\u2019re teaming up or turning on each other, every match is a test of speed, reflexes, and friendship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for Teasing</strong> \u2013 Easy controls mean anyone can join in, but only the bold (and lucky) can claim victory. Trash talk encouraged.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From the World of Running Fable</strong> \u2013 Return to a vibrant, fabled universe full of quirky characters, ridiculous physics, and hilarious animations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/d54e38d96387f5b70b51170fc33e93af.poster.avif?t=1768836594\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/d54e38d96387f5b70b51170fc33e93af.webm?t=1768836594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/extras/d54e38d96387f5b70b51170fc33e93af.mp4?t=1768836594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It\u2019s not just a party \u2014 it\u2019s a battlefield disguised in balloons.</strong><br><i>Running Fable Petite Party</i> is what happens when tabletop strategy meets competitive chaos. Who will stand victorious? And who will never live that loss down?</p>","developers":["Seashell Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866300/5